    "body": "Status of the spindle slice. No PR is open yet.\n\n- Branch: `qsmits:issue/3643-tool-assemblies`\n- Head: `f2eedafa096e4999354e207dd28f5ef41ee67fa2`\n- Stacked on #4096 (head `57f36190017c9f3dc547022285c1e96696ec376e`). The own commits are `57f361900..f2eedafa0`.\n\n**What is done (in `camcraft-tools` only, no new crate edge):**\n- `frame.rs`: a checked rigid frame. It composes, turns about Z (`z_rot_deg`) and moves along Z.\n- `component_geometry.rs`: the port frames, the cutting point and the revolved body of one #3642 component. `ComponentGeometry::holder` makes a built-in library holder a component.\n- `tool_assembly.rs` (with `_body.rs` and `_error.rs`): forward kinematics from the root MCS to the cutting tip. It gives these values:\n  - the gauge length;\n  - the cutting diameter and corner radius (from a solid tool, or from an insert and its seat);\n  - the judged `HolderProfile` that the collision laws read today.\n- Named refusals: the #3642 fit errors, a missing frame, an ambiguous or taken port, a cycle, a bad parent, two roots or two cutters, a non-finite turn or stickout, a stickout off a plain or Weldon bore, an off-axis body, and a body in the flutes.\n- Equivalence pins: a BT30 ER20 chuck with an ER20 collet and an end mill, and a BT40 Weldon 12 mm holder with an end mill. Each gives the same gauge length and the same bands as today's `HolderRef` (within 1e-9 mm).\n- Decision: `docs/decisions/3643-tool-assemblies.md`.\n\n**Gate (Windows build lane, tree = head `f2eedafa0` merged with origin/main as `b8a24960b`):**\n- Log `C:\\camcraft-logs\\gate-3643-f2eedafa096e4999354e207dd28f5ef41ee67fa2.log`, first line `head f2eedafa096e4999354e207dd28f5ef41ee67fa2`.\n- `cargo xtask gate quick --base origin/main`: 1 step, `tools suites: lib` ok, 0 failed. The 8 new tests in `tool_assembly_tests` pass.\n- `cargo xtask gate light`: 6 steps ok, 0 failed, 0 stalled.\n- `cargo clippy -p camcraft-tools --all-targets -- -D warnings`: clean.\n\n**Still open on #3643:** the lathe side (`LatheClearance`, orientation 1-8, `MAX_TIP_GAP`), STEP/STL/OBJ mesh bodies, `MCS_INSERT` as `CsysRole::Mounting`, and `crates/app/src/tool_assembly.rs`.\n\nPR to be opened when the open-PR count allows. The claim stays.\n",
