    "body": "The stacked branch `issue/3643-tool-assemblies` has the new #4096 head now. The new head is `61e0f593e`.\n\n- The branch merges the #4096 review fixes (head `d36523d9d`) with `git merge`. There is no rebase and no force-push.\n- The merge was clean. The #3643 code needed no change for the new checks.\n- Gate on `61e0f593e` (Windows, winbuild): `cargo clippy -p camcraft-tools --all-targets -- -D warnings` is clean. `cargo xtask gate quick --base origin/main` runs `tools suites: lib`: 173 passed, 0 failed.\n- There is no PR for #3643 yet.\n",
